linux-user: fix build against modern glibc

Four compatibility fixes for glibc 2.28..2.41 hosts:

- struct ucontext was removed in glibc 2.30; use ucontext_t.
- gettid() is declared by glibc 2.30+, so QEMU's static helper is
  renamed to qemu_gettid().
- stime() was removed in glibc 2.31; implement the target stime case
  with syscall(SYS_settimeofday, ...).
- linux-user/strace.c needs <sys/sysmacros.h> for major()/minor().

Signed-off-by: jeep <jeep@local>

